Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: gs101-pixel: fuel gauge is supplied by the max77759 charger

Local only (not for upstream). Without a supplier link max17042 reports
POWER_SUPPLY_STATUS_UNKNOWN, so UPower/Plasma never show charging.
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-pixel-common.dtsi	2026-10-08 14:12:14.736472471 -0500
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-pixel-common.dtsi	2026-10-08 14:12:14.749900086 -0500
@@ -1209,9 +1209,10 @@
 		interrupts-extended = <&gpa9 3 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_LOW>;
 
 		shunt-resistor-micro-ohms = <5000>;
+		power-supplies = <&max77759_pmic>;
 	};
 
-	pmic@66 {
+	max77759_pmic: pmic@66 {
 		compatible = "maxim,max77759";
 		reg = <0x66>;
 
